## 3. Tool Interface Mapping
Map the following abstract operations to your available toolchain (Chrome DevTools Protocol / MCP, Playwright, or Puppeteer):

| Abstract Operation | Chrome DevTools MCP | Playwright / Puppeteer Equivalent | Execution Rule |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Inspect Semantics** | `take_snapshot` | `page.accessibility.snapshot()` | Capture first to establish element unique identifiers (`uid` / accessibility node). |
| **Inspect Visuals** | `take_screenshot` | `page.screenshot()` | Capture viewport or component-level bounding box to evaluate colors, layout, and occlusion. |
| **Click Element** | `click` | `page.click(selector)` | Use semantic `uid` or selector. Set `includeSnapshot: true` to observe post-click state. |
| **Click Coordinates** | `click_at` | `page.mouse.click(x, y)` | Use when target lacks semantic roles (Canvas, WebGL, SVG icons, floating badges). |
| **Hover / Mouseover** | `hover` | `page.hover(selector)` | Trigger CSS `:hover`, dynamic dropdowns, or tooltips. Re-inspect snapshot immediately. |
| **Form Entry** | `fill_form` | Sequential `fill()` | **Always batch form inputs** (text, checkboxes, selects) into a single call to minimize roundtrips. |
| **Keyboard Input** | `type_text`, `press_key` | `page.keyboard.press()` | Send key sequences (`Enter`, `Tab`, `Escape`, `Control+C`, `Control+V`). |
| **Drag & Drop** | `drag` | `page.dragAndDrop()` | Specify source and destination target identifiers. |
| **File Upload** | `upload_file` | `page.setInputFiles()` | Provide absolute local file path to the `<input type="file">` node. |
| **Navigation & Refresh**| `navigate_page` | `page.goto()`, `page.reload()`| Set `ignoreCache: true` when reloading after source code edits. |
| **Script Execution** | `evaluate_script` | `page.evaluate()` | Execute client-side JavaScript to retrieve computed metrics, bounding boxes, or storage state. |
| **Wait Condition** | `wait_for` | `page.waitForSelector()` | Wait for deterministic text or element visibility before proceeding. |
| **Diagnostics** | `list_console_messages` | `page.on('console')` | Audit uncaught runtime exceptions and network errors (4xx/5xx). |

