### SOP 4: Performance & Latency Benchmarking
To profile page load speed and asset footprint:
```javascript
() => {
  const [nav] = performance.getEntriesByType("navigation");
  if (!nav) return null;
  return {
    ttfbMs: Math.round(nav.responseStart - nav.requestStart),
    domInteractiveMs: Math.round(nav.domInteractive - nav.startTime),
    domContentLoadedMs: Math.round(nav.domContentLoadedEventEnd - nav.startTime),
    loadCompleteMs: Math.round(nav.loadEventEnd - nav.startTime),
    transferSizeBytes: nav.transferSize
  };
}
```

